txt2crs Subsystem Licensing
===========================

Licensing Scope
---------------

This license applies only to the directory containing this file
(`src/txt2crs/`) and its subdirectories. It does not grant, replace, restrict,
or otherwise modify the license of any file outside that directory tree.
A more specific license within a subdirectory takes precedence for the files
within its stated scope.

Except where a source file or portion is explicitly identified as derived from
Hermes Agent, all original txt2crs code is licensed under the MIT No
Attribution License (MIT-0) below.

Code copied or materially adapted from Hermes Agent remains licensed under the
MIT License and must retain the Nous Research copyright and license notice
included later in this file.

As a repository boundary, any code copied, adapted, or explicitly documented
as inspired by Hermes Agent must live within `src/txt2crs/` or one of its
subdirectories.


