Provenance Requirements
=======================

Original source files should use:

    SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT-0

Files containing code copied or materially adapted from Hermes Agent must use:

    SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT

Hermes-derived files must also identify the donor project, original relative
path, evaluated revision, and substantial local modifications in a short
source comment. Existing Hermes copyright, license, and attribution notices
must be preserved.
